// A deeply nested expression must not overflow the compiler stack and abort.
// The parser (recursive descent) and the typeck/codegen tree walks recurse
// once per nesting level; before makac ran the compile on a large-stack
// worker thread, ~1000 levels of nesting crashed with a stack overflow and no
// diagnostic.  This nests 1500 levels (well past that point).
